00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,400
my grandfather contacted lots of people to find him.

289
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:28,880
I had just bought it for my father.

290
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:30,760
Before that day,

291
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,640
I had never told anyone about it.

292
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:34,240
The story between my father and my mother.

293
00:15:35,560 --> 00:15:38,040
But seeing these disgusting images in surveillance,

294
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,840
his image as a father

295
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:41,920
completely fell apart for me.

296
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:43,840
After that,

297
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:44,880
the contents of the camera,

298
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:46,160
I didn't want to watch it anymore.

299
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:48,880
And if I had to describe in two words

300
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:50,200
the one I call my father,

301
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:51,040
it would be:

302
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,080
garbage.

303
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:00,800
And then this Feng Shu,

304
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:04,240
he is in cahoots with Gao Yuhai.

305
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:05,520
What kind of man he is,

306
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:06,920
Gao Yuhai knows this very well.

307
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:09,320
But he still forced me to marry him.

308
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,800
If it wasn't because of Shen Xi's matter,

309
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:15,600
I would probably already be engaged to him by now.

310
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:18,280
Even a fierce tiger does not devour its cubs.

311
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,280
How can we

312
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:22,400
push your own daughter

313
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:23,840
in the mouth of the wolf?

314
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:34,480
Exactly,

315
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:38,000
Shen Xi left a recording for the two of you.

316
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:39,480
Let's listen to it together.

317
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,480
I lost my honor,

318
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:44,920
I lost love.

319
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:48,800
What sense is there in me still living?

320
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,360
This bottle of medicine...

321
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:52,440
I've been preparing for a long time,

322
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:55,600
but I never had the courage to swallow it.

323
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:58,880
That day,

324
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:01,600
I was on the roof,

325
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:05,280
and I danced the main role one last time

326
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:07,960
that Song Yanfei had written for me, with all my soul.

327
00:17:09,079 --> 00:17:10,760
I told myself that I no longer had any regrets.

328
00:17:12,040 --> 00:17:14,319
But just as I was about to swallow this bottle,

329
00:17:15,319 --> 00:17:16,520
I suddenly realized

330
00:17:17,280 --> 00:17:19,640
that I still had one important thing left to accomplish.

331
00:17:21,800 --> 00:17:23,440
Tuer Gao Yuhai —

332
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:26,319
this scum who hid behind a mask of virtue.

333
00:17:27,079 --> 00:17:27,920
I knew

334
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:31,080
that he went to the old house every Saturday.

335
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:33,520
That day happened to fall on a Saturday.

336
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:35,400
I decided

337
00:17:37,040 --> 00:17:38,400
to take action that day.

